From 79aaa8ddb50ae7dc903354d689a2f0c5c66176e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:27:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CoCoSDC: port the nowhereman999 fork's emulation onto
 upstream

Takes src/cocosdc*.c/h and the three CoCoSDC host test programs from
https://github.com/nowhereman999/xroar at 39ff26093eb852b74d5297b926e794c7b7a04089
onto upstream 128d7c645fc2ed96cc9425f163dc5b927ca32d91, replacing upstream's
ROM-and-latch stub.

- Build cocosdc without --enable-experimental (Makefile.am, part.c).
- Cart profile 'cocosdc' defaults cart-rom @sdcdos; romlist sdcdos.
- New option -sdc-root DIR (xroar.c, xroar.h).
- Front-end hooks for the Android build: cocosdc_sd_root(),
  cocosdc_mount_host() (cocosdc.h) and sdc_fs_mount_host().
